    "title": "Timeout e intervalli in JS",
    "descriptionContent": "Scopri i metodi asincroni in JavaScript: setTimeout, setInterval e clearInterval.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17660,
        "title": "setTimeout",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JavaScript dispone di alcuni metodi nativi che eseguono il codice in modo asincrono, come <code>setTimeout()</code> e <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><p>In questo capitolo esamineremo il metodo <code>setTimeout()</code> usando esempi simili a giochi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il metodo <code>setTimeout()</code> imposta un timer, in millisecondi, che esegue una funzione o un blocco di codice quando il timer scade.</p><p>Scrivi il tuo primo metodo <code>setTimeout</code> nel codice di esempio.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il codice qui è asincrono. Questo significa che, mentre aspettiamo l'esecuzione del <em>callback</em>, viene eseguito il codice dopo il metodo <code>setTimeout</code>.</p><p>L'output della console del metodo <code>setTimeout</code> verrà mostrato per ultimo a causa del ritardo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il parametro <code>delay</code> è il tempo, espresso in millisecondi, che trascorre prima che la funzione o il blocco di codice venga eseguito.</p><p>Nel codice seguente, imposta un ritardo di <code>2000</code> millisecondi prima dell'esecuzione del blocco di codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up charging&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ready after 2 seconds&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep playing while it charges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> è sempre asincrono, anche se il parametro <code>delay</code> viene omesso o lo impostiamo su <code>0</code>.</p><p>Con un <code>delay</code> pari a <code>0</code>, il codice dopo il metodo <code>setTimeout()</code> viene eseguito immediatamente, ma la funzione di callback viene eseguita <em>il prima possibile</em>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred UI update (runs asap)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> esegue il <code>callback</code> dopo il <code>delay</code> specificato.</p><p>Il codice <em>dopo</em><code>setTimeout</code> continua a essere eseguito indipendentemente dal fatto che venga usato un callback o un blocco di codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"120\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned after delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(spawnEnemy, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player exploring...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>spawnEnemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149757,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale affermazione è vera riguardo ai metodi JavaScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">JavaScript dispone di alcuni metodi che eseguono il codice in modo asincrono</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">JavaScript ha solo metodi che eseguono il codice in modo sincrono</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">JavaScript dispone di alcuni metodi che eseguono il codice in modo asincrono.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149758,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa il metodo <code>setTimeout()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Esegue una funzione di callback quando scade un timer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Imposta solo un timer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Esegue una funzione di callback quando scade un timer.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale affermazione è vera riguardo al metodo <code>setTimeout()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">È un metodo JavaScript asincrono</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">È un metodo JavaScript sincrono</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">È un metodo JavaScript asincrono.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa il parametro <code>delay</code> di <code>setTimeout()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Specifica quanti millisecondi trascorrono prima che venga eseguito il callback</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fa sì che tutto il codice smetta di essere eseguito</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Specifica quanti millisecondi trascorrono prima che venga eseguito il callback.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore predefinito del parametro <code>delay</code> quando non gli passiamo alcun valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0 millisecondi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1000 millisecondi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">0 millisecondi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando viene eseguita la funzione di callback di <code>setTimeout()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dopo la scadenza del timer impostato dal parametro <code>delay</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima che scada il timer impostato dal parametro <code>delay</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dopo la scadenza del timer impostato dal parametro <code>delay</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149763,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il metodo <code>setTimeout()</code> per completare il codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"204\" endIndex=\"214\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"9000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica un ritardo di <code>8000</code> millisecondi nel metodo <code>setTimeout()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"253\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"8000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>8000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice in modo che la funzione di callback venga eseguita il prima possibile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"113\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred collision check, even with no delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 149766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la funzione di callback che stampa il risultato di <code>simulateBattle()</code>, come primo parametro di <code>setTimeout()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"265\" endIndex=\"274\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(showScore, \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>showScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
