      {
        "id": 17661,
        "title": "setInterval e clearInterval",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> è un altro metodo nativo di JavaScript che esegue il codice in modo asincrono.</p><p>Con <code>setInterval</code> possiamo eseguire una piccola parte del ciclo di gioco a intervalli di tempo prestabiliti. Scopriamo di più su questo metodo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> accetta una funzione di callback e un intervallo come parametri. Qui, <code>toggleInvincibility</code> attiva e disattiva l'invincibilità del giocatore.</p><p>Passa la funzione callback e l'intervallo alla chiamata <code>setInterval</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"217\" endIndex=\"228\" /><option startIndex=\"229\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>setInterval</code>, seguito da <code>toggleInvincibility</code> e infine <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval</code> esegue la funzione di callback per sempre, con un ritardo pari al numero di millisecondi specificato che passiamo come secondo parametro.</p><p>La prima esecuzione del callback avviene dopo il tempo specificato. Non viene eseguito immediatamente.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se eseguiamo il codice, potremmo ricevere un errore di timeout perché non c'è alcun arresto per <code>setInterval</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi qui <code>500</code> millisecondi per fare lampeggiare il potenziamento per sempre ogni <code>500</code> millisecondi!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"218\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per impedire che <code>setInterval()</code> venga eseguito indefinitamente, possiamo usare il metodo <code>clearInterval</code>.<br /></p><p>Possiamo salvare <code>setInterval</code> in una variabile <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>. Poi usa <code>clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval)</code> all'interno di un <code>setTimeout</code> da eseguire dopo <code>2500</code> millisecondi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"340\" endIndex=\"344\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>let</code>, seguito da <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> e poi <code>clearInterval</code>, <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>, <code>2500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il metodo <code>clearInterval()</code> accetta <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> come unico parametro.</p><p>Durante l'esecuzione, interrompe l'azione ripetuta del metodo <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>clearInterval</code>, seguito da <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
